library_preparation_preflight.agent_guidance:
Add the native-image build argument -H:+SharedArenaSupport to the generated test's build.gradle, e.g.:

graalvmNative {
    binaries {
        test {
            buildArgs.add('-H:+SharedArenaSupport')
        }
    }
    agent { ... }
}

This is the same root cause and fix already applied in this repo for io.lettuce:lettuce-core:7.0.0.RELEASE (PR #10454), which also transitively pulled Netty 4.2.x. Netty only added automatic feature-detection/fallback for this in 4.2.8.Final (netty/netty#15762); reactor-netty-http:1.3.0 depends on 4.2.7.Final, one patch release too early, so the flag is needed rather than a dependency bump.
